              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ટપાલી — ṭapālī — \"postman\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ટપાલી સવારે ટપાલ લાવે છે. — ṭapālī savāre ṭapāl lāve che — \"The postman brings the post in the morning.\""
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Built on ટપાલ, ṭapāl, 'post'."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ટપાલી (ṭapālī) is built on ṭapāl, \"post, mail\", with the agent ending -ī. The origin of ṭapāl is not settled: neither CDIAL nor DEDR has an entry for it."
            }
          ]
        },
